# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Age & Gender Detection — .gitignore
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Trained model weights (≈26 MB each) ───────────────────────────────────
# Keep locally; decide on Git LFS or external storage before first push.
age_model.h5
gender_model.h5

# ── Python virtual environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Python bytecode & caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo

# ── Environment / secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env

# ── Personal test images ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Common image formats that a user might drop in the project root while testing
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.bmp
*.webp
# Exclude the rule above only for explicitly tracked assets (none at present).
# If you later add images that SHOULD be committed, force-add them:
#   git add -f path/to/image.jpg

# ── Jupyter / IPython ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep the notebook itself; only ignore auto-generated artefacts.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints

# ── Distribution / packaging ───────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
MANIFEST
wheels/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# ── Testing & coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
*.coveragerc

# ── Type-checking ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
.pyright/

# ── OS-generated files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Linux
*~

# ── Editor / IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VS Code
.vscode/

# JetBrains (PyCharm, etc.)
.idea/
*.iml

# Vim / Emacs
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.orig
[#]*[#]
.\#*

# ── Logs & temporary files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
